{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20120","headline":"同溧阳宰送孙秀才 · 孟郊","name":"同溧阳宰送孙秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"废瑟难爲弦，南风难爲歌。\n幽幽拙疾中，忽忽浮梦多。\n清韵始啸侣，雅言相与和。\n讼闲每往招，祖送奈若何。\n牵苦强爲赠，邦邑光峨峨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}